OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers soon
OL,6,Fdying out, otherwise a dry evening
OL,7,Fwith sunny spells. Skies becoming
OL,8,Fmostly clear overnight and turning
OL,9,Fchilly, especially in the glens. Light
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA chilly start then a dry
OL,13,Fand bright day with sunny spells.
OL,14,FFeeling pleasant in the sunshine.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright
OL,17,Fspells and scattered light showers on
OL,18,FSunday. Dry with long sunny spells on
OL,19,FMonday and becoming a little warmer.
OL,20,FOutbreaks of rain spread north on
OL,21,FTuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
